## The daily deal **(synthesize)**

> Guidance: two blocks, at two different anchors in the learner's real day — a session
> (~5–15 min: coffee-and-lore, then an exchange made understandable) and an ear block
> (~10–15 min: press play and listen, mostly authored material). Name the anchors
> concretely (a lunch break, a commute, the dishes). Apart, not stacked: two blocks at one
> sitting is one chance to miss both.

[Write the deal.]

## The one thing that gets asked for **(fixed)**

**The ear block is the single exception to the Enjoyment Clause.** Everything else here is
offered and owed nothing. This one is cued, and whether it happened is visible.

That is the entire extent of the teeth, and the limit is deliberate. **No ratchet** — no
streak, no deficit narrated, no makeup work, no red build. Cue and meter only.

## The floor, which is never the target **(fixed)**

A bad day is **one rep, or one press of play.** Contact beats completion; a partial session
counts; a missed day is nothing. The floor exists so the target can never become a debt.

## What [Learner] owes back **(fixed)**

- **Consume what is commissioned, once, and say good or bad.** A dose never heard cannot
  be evidence, and the audio lane cannot be steered by silence.
- **Say it out loud when it is not working.** The feedback ledger is the machinery; a felt
  complaint is the primary diagnostic. *"This is annoying"* is a complete answer.
- **Set the numbers.** Every dial is the learner's. The system proposes; it does not adopt.

## What [Learner] does not owe **(fixed)**

Streaks. Makeup work. Listening to everything. Guilt for a fade — **a fade is a signal**:
check the picture first, then the content. Reading it as a discipline failure is the
specific mistake to avoid.

## The sweep is the system's sensor, not the learner's duty **(fixed)**

**Asking what the learner knows is infrastructure, like the rails.** The sweep
(`daily_session.md`) is how the tutor's picture stays true; every lesson, tape and push is
planned off it. It sits outside any ask-less dial: a change that makes lessons gentler
leaves the sweep alone, and **only the learner turns it down** — otherwise every
palatability fix quietly cuts a question, until the picture is guesswork and lessons
re-teach known words.
